; Shadow Skimmer has no tape image in this project: the source is the snapshot
; SHADSKIM.Z80 (dated 31-10-1996, 41483 bytes, from ShadowSkimmer.z80.zip),
; taken after the BASIC loader had loaded the code block and while it waited
; at line 30 (PAUSE 0). The Makefile copies it to build/shadskim.z80 instead
; of running tap2sna.py, so this file is a provenance record only; the skill's
; snapshot rule still names it as a prerequisite.
